sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant Shop as Shop API
  participant Pay as Payment API
  participant DB as Orders DB
  C->>Shop: place order
  Shop->>DB: save pending order
  Shop->>Pay: charge card
  Pay-->>Shop: charge id
  Shop-->>C: processing
  Pay-)Shop: webhook: paid
  Note over Shop: verify the signature
  Shop->>DB: mark order paid
  Shop-)C: receipt email
